{"id":8893264,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/8826","number":8826,"state":"merged","title":"fix(gmmsqv2): correct A8W4/A4W4 per-group output shape on WeightNZ path","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/8826","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/8826/issues","body":"## 描述\n<!--在这里详细描述你的改动，包括改动的原因和所采取的方法。-->\ngrouped_matmul_swiglu_quant_v2 算子在 A8W4/A4W4 per-group 量化、WeightNZ 路径下输出 shape 计算错误。根因：per-group 的 weightScale 为 3D（[E, KGroup, N]），与 MX multi-weight scale rank 相同，旧代码用 weightScaleDimNum 判断 isMxShape 时将 per-group 误判为 MX 场景，导致 N 维索引取错、输出 [M, N/2] 计算错误。\n\n改动内容：\n- `op_host/grouped_matmul_swiglu_quant_v2_infershape.cpp`：`isMxShape` 判定去掉 `weightScaleDimNum == MX_SINGLE/MULTI_WEIGHT_SCALE_DIM` 的 rank 判断，仅保留 `quantMode == QUANT_MODE_MX_TYPE`。\n- `op_api/grouped_matmul_swiglu_quant_v2.cpp`：`n` 改取 weightScale 末维 `GetDim(weightScaleDimNum - 1)`，兼容 2D [E,N] 与 3D [E,KGroup,N]；DAV_3510 路径新增 `quantMode == QUANT_MODE_PERTOKEN` 分支，perToken 下 N 恒取末维（per-channel [E,N]、per-group [E,KGroup,N] 末维均为 N，不受 transposeWeight 影响），MX 保留原 transpose 逻辑。新增 `QUANT_MODE_PERTOKEN=0` 常量。\n- `op_api/aclnn_..._weight_nz.cpp`、`op_api/..._utils.h`：新增 `std::cout` 调试日志，追踪 post-7302 路径 WeightNz API 入口、weight 处理前后 shape/format 与 CheckPerToken 前后状态，便于定位问题。\n\n## 关联的Issue\n<!-- 如果这个PR是为了解决特定的Issue，请在这里提供Issue链接。例如：关联Issue #000-->\n<!-- 如果这个PR是为了解决特定的问题单，请在这里描述问题单单号。-->\n#3885\n\n## 测试\n<!--描述进行了哪些测试来验证你的改动。包括但不限于二级冒烟、算子泛化等。-->\n新增 UT 用例：\n- op_api：`ascend910b_a8w4_weightnz_single_pergroup_path`（Ascend910B，A8W4 WeightNzV2 per-group，期望成功）。\n- infershape：`test_infershape_a8w4_weightnz_pergroup`（Ascend910B，A8W4 WeightNZ per-group，19:32 输入，FRACTAL_NZ weight，per-group 256:64:64 weightScale，期望正常推导）。\n\n## 文档更新\n<!--如果这个PR包含文档的更新，请在这里指出。例如：更新了README.md文件。-->\n无\n\n## 类型标签\n<!--  [x] 表示选中 -->\n- [x] \uD83D\uDC1B Bug修复\n- [ ] ✨ 新特性\n- [ ] ⚡ 性能优化\n- [ ] ♻️ 重构\n- [ ] \uD83E\uDDEA 测试\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDCE6 构建/CI\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD27 配置变更\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDCDD 文档更新\n- [ ] ⬆️ 依赖升级\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD12 安全修复\n- [ ] \uD83E\uDDF9 代码清理\n- [ ] ❓ 其他，请描述：\n","assignees_number":14,"assignees":[{"id":"6881fc1e35dc04365328fd5b","login":"shi-rui","name":"shi-rui","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/shi-rui","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c87d24adff5452d7ba18","login":"Allan_Yu","name":"YuZhengzhong","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Allan_Yu","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68a2d9713ae52525f638663b","login":"kknan","name":"kknan","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bb/ed/29bb4edce36f6a79335236781c280d8cf2d7afbab499fc95b8939246f5b6f3ac.png?time=1763003448048","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/kknan","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c17d24adff5452d7b741","login":"wuyi_huawei","name":"wuyi_51","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wuyi_huawei","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c115ac4dcd85262391d21a","login":"wenxin_fight","name":"wenxin_fight","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wenxin_fight","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c1382c7f18604d4aaabbee","login":"mabing1118","name":"mabing","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/mabing1118","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822b81724adff5452d7afc2","login":"monologue815","name":"monologue815","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/monologue815","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68844ee22fa6cc24b2556707","login":"cc-z","name":"赵臣臣","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cc-z","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6877715d70f8532fca319fe9","login":"liudan12","name":"liudan12","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/liudan12","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"680b67997740957d853d456f","login":"chenkang30","name":"chen-kang30","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fe/ac/6fea71c32ba6524182e040c77cc74299e9cbff6953f80c3fc114303b35e60036.png","html_url":"https://gitc